same geographical location with the same qualifications and specialized experience.", "display_url": "usajobs.gov/job/889752600", "end": 159, "expanded_url": "https://www.usajobs.gov/job/889752600", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113338622053113857/nXQt0WPu?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113338622053113857/nXQt0WPu?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 136, "status": 200, "title": "IT Specialist (Policy and Planning)", "unwound_url": "https://www.usajobs.gov/job/889752600", "url": "https://t.co/curzbIOLJc"}, {"description": "This vacancy is for an IT Specialist (OS) position in the Office of Information Technology Services located at the Bureau of Economic Analysis. This Job Opportunity Announcement may be used to fill other IT Specialist (OS) , ZP-2210-3 positions within the Bureau of Economic Analysis in the same geographical location with the same qualifications and specialized experience.", "display_url": "usajobs.gov/job/889750100", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://www.usajobs.gov/job/889750100", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113338616915046400/17Ax5Wtd?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113338616915046400/17Ax5Wtd?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 180, "status": 200, "title": "IT Specialist (OS)", "unwound_url": "https://www.usajobs.gov/job/889750100", "url": "https://t.co/ANQTYXEDRV"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/D69qF9AyiG", "end": 227, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2114718805750423611/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114718795369521153", "start": 204, "url": "https://t.co/D69qF9AyiG"}]}, "id": "2114718805750423611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 696, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "We’re hiring! For these positions: \n\nIT Specialist (Applications Software)\nhttps://t.co/dMHQ7IUGPM\n\nIT Specialist (Policy and Planning)\nhttps://t.co/curzbIOLJc\n\nIT Specialist (OS)\nhttps://t.co/ANQTYXEDRV https://t.co/D69qF9AyiG", "url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2114718805750423611"}, {"author_id": "59603406", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:23:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114709406537355693"], "id": "2114709406537355693", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 74, "impression_count": 74512, "like_count": 416, "quote_count": 19, "reply_count": 62, "retweet_count": 87}, "text": "The Fed is expected to hold rates steady Wednesday, but it is a closer call on the data than the market-implied probabilities suggest.\n\nThe case for hiking: \n1) The hot September CPI and PPI underscore a second straight lost year for getting inflation down\n2) With a Dec hike", "url": "https://x.com/NickTimiraos/status/2114709406537355693"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:00:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114703806965399552"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 108, "start": 100, "tag": "economy"}, {"end": 117, "start": 109, "tag": "markets"}], "mentions": [{"end": 28, "id": "33792634", "start": 14, "username": "andrewrsorkin"}, {"end": 41, "id": "119372054", "start": 30, "username": "BeckyQuick"}, {"end": 56, "id": "553036368", "start": 46, "username": "JoeSquawk"}, {"end": 85, "id": "404422077", "start": 74, "username": "SquawkCNBC"}, {"end": 123, "id": "20402945", "start": 118, "username": "CNBC"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4Y7qO4or7W", "end": 147, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2114703806965399552/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114703803387641856", "start": 124, "url": "https://t.co/4Y7qO4or7W"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4Y7qO4or7W", "end": 147, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2114703806965399552/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114703803400290304", "start": 124, "url": "https://t.co/4Y7qO4or7W"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4Y7qO4or7W", "end": 147, "expanded_ur